OL,3,GNEWSAProbe after dead puppies found in
OL,4,Afield
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police and RSPCA are appealing for
OL,7,Finformation after several deceased
OL,8,Fpuppies were found in a field in
OL,9,FDetling.
OL,11,FA member of the public discovered the
OL,12,Fremains near Detling Community Store
OL,13,Fand Post Office in Pilgrims Way at
OL,14,Fabout 15:00 BST on 10 August.
OL,16,FKent Police said officers attended the
OL,17,Fscene and later found several more
OL,18,Fshallow burial sites in the same field,
OL,19,Fwhile the RSPCA said the exact number
OL,20,Fof dead puppies is not yet known.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
