OL,3,GNEWSAProbe after dead puppies found in
OL,4,Afield
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Tristan Stevens, of Kent
OL,7,FPolice, said: "This is a deeply
OL,8,Fupsetting incident and investigators
OL,9,Fare working with partner agencies to
OL,10,Festablish what happened to the animals
OL,11,Fand how they arrived at the site."
